WEBVTT

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.708
Darn... We don't get any
tourists at all these days.

00:00:26.708 --> 00:00:29.333
We have to get our popularity
back one way or another.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:38.417
Oh... I'm Iceland... a new character.

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:40.500
Ah!

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:43.500
Hetalia. Hetalia. Hetalia.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.083
H-Help!!

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.167
Gentlemen! This is an emergency!

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:55.667
As the document in front of you states,
a majority of the people around the world

00:02:55.667 --> 00:02:59.917
have been turned into <i>noppera</i>
by the suspicious beam of light

00:02:59.917 --> 00:03:03.292
shot by <i>noppera</i>-<i>bou</i>!
According to my friend Tony,

00:03:03.292 --> 00:03:08.167
they're Pictonians from the
planet Picto, a far-off planet in space!

00:03:08.167 --> 00:03:10.000
You watch too many movies, you idiot!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.792
They're born as <i>noppera</i>

00:03:11.792 --> 00:03:14.042
and are planning to
turn people on every planet

00:03:14.042 --> 00:03:15.167
"Yummy" "Pasta"
into <i>noppera</i>!

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:19.708
However, we cannot allow such a
thing to happen on our planet, Earth!

00:03:19.708 --> 00:03:22.000
Let's put a firm stop to their plans!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.958
By the way...

00:03:23.958 --> 00:03:26.083
...what's a <i>noppera</i>?

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.458
Well... that's probably...

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:31.333
Hm?

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:37.000
a Japanese monster, with no eyes,
nose or mouth, called <i>noppera</i>-<i>bou</i>.

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.917
Oh man! It's Japan's fault that they came here?!

00:03:39.917 --> 00:03:43.417
Oh no, I was just explaining what
the word <i>noppera </i>means, that's all.

00:03:43.417 --> 00:03:47.292
Why do I have to be turned
into <i>noppera </i>because of Japan?!

00:03:47.292 --> 00:03:49.167
No, like I said...

00:03:49.167 --> 00:03:53.167
Anyway, I want to hear your opinions
on how we can overcome this crisis!

00:03:53.167 --> 00:03:55.958
Well, since no one has
piped in, I'll tell you my idea!

00:03:55.958 --> 00:03:58.208
We'll simply resist with everything we've got!

00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:01.500
We'll join every country's
military together under my command!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.083
Gather under my flag!

00:04:03.083 --> 00:04:06.208
Gather under the white flag! Flap, flap, flap!

00:04:06.208 --> 00:04:08.375
Why is it under <i>your </i>command?!

00:04:08.375 --> 00:04:10.583
Oh! That's because I'm a hero.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:11.542
Your nickname is.

00:04:11.542 --> 00:04:13.250
By the way, my nickname is amaz--

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.708
Shut up, you wine-loving bastard!

00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:16.042
Ah, I heard that, you former delinquent?!

00:04:16.042 --> 00:04:18.375
I've told you not to call me that so many times!

00:04:18.375 --> 00:04:19.500
They're fighting again?

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.792
Who wants white flags?! I made plenty!

00:04:22.792 --> 00:04:25.250
Hey, let's all surrender together!

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:27.667
You'll agree with me, right?

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.958
Er... Well, if it's about money,
I'll see what I we can do,

00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:31.542
but if it's about military and such...

00:04:31.542 --> 00:04:32.292
Russia!

00:04:32.292 --> 00:04:34.000
--Hm?
--What're you going to do?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.625
Of course, we'll fight.

00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:38.542
All right! Then I've got a perfect job for you.

00:04:38.542 --> 00:04:39.542
You back me up!

00:04:39.542 --> 00:04:40.375
What?

00:04:40.375 --> 00:04:42.792
Everyone knows that the one
who saves mankind from a crisis is

00:04:42.792 --> 00:04:44.208
the hero, America, right?

00:04:44.208 --> 00:04:47.000
Hollywood makes lots of
movies like that, too, you know!

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.042
If you're talking about war
movies, we make them too!

00:04:49.042 --> 00:04:51.625
Oh, you mean stuff like
moving time lines, huh?

00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:54.958
Shut up! Movies at your place are
full of lines that set my teeth on edge

00:04:54.958 --> 00:04:57.250
and lyrical music. They make me sleepy.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.458
We've been releasing lots of hit movies, too!

00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:02.583
But you can't defeat aliens with horses.

00:05:02.583 --> 00:05:04.583
<i>Ai ya</i>! That's insulting!

00:05:04.583 --> 00:05:07.583
By the way, ours are rather a little low-key.

00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:10.917
The war movies at my place are interesting!

00:05:10.917 --> 00:05:13.792
They go to Germany and
become intimate with German girls!

00:05:13.792 --> 00:05:16.417
They go to Greece and
become intimate with Greek girls!

00:05:16.417 --> 00:05:19.250
Even when they go to Russia, they
become intimate with Russian girls, too!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:24.083
If they fight aliens, I bet they'll
become intimate with alien girls, right?

00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:26.708
That's enough! As we speak,
more of mankind could be

00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:30.833
getting turned into <i>noppera</i>
by Pictonians or whatever!

00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:34.250
Listen! Being turned into
<i>noppera </i>means we all lose our face,

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:38.333
so we can't tell who each other is!
Think about it carefully, you dumbasses!

00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:41.458
I'll never accept your opinion!

00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:43.917
Same goes to you, you idiot!

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:46.750
I'm always right!

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:50.167
I can only accept my own ideas, no one else's.

00:05:50.167 --> 00:05:53.042
I'll only accept my own ideas, too.

00:05:53.042 --> 00:05:56.708
U-Uhm... I am... well... so... uhm...

00:06:05.292 --> 00:06:08.958
All right. I've had enough.

00:06:08.958 --> 00:06:12.417
After all, it was impossible
to have a decent discussion

00:06:12.417 --> 00:06:14.542
with you guys from the start.

00:06:14.542 --> 00:06:18.375
This is precisely what you
would call a waste of time.

00:06:20.292 --> 00:06:23.500
Do whatever you want.
I'll do what I have to do.

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.292
I was going to do it from the start.

00:06:32.292 --> 00:06:35.625
I don't want to go down with these
guys by fighting together with them.

00:06:35.625 --> 00:06:38.917
I don't intend to fight together with England.

00:06:38.917 --> 00:06:41.208
Shut up. That's my line.

00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:43.542
Don't come crying to me for help later!

00:06:43.542 --> 00:06:46.292
Oh... it hurts! My stomach hurts!

00:06:46.292 --> 00:06:47.542
Ahh!

00:06:47.542 --> 00:06:52.417
Wait up! Don't leave me alone!

00:06:56.417 --> 00:07:01.417
After all, no one asked
me my opinion, did they?

00:07:01.417 --> 00:07:03.250
--Who are you?
--I'm Canada.

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:28.167
"Hetalia Movie"

00:07:28.167 --> 00:07:30.458
Hey, hey!

00:07:30.458 --> 00:07:33.167
Now it's time for "Dancing Prussia,"

00:07:33.167 --> 00:07:35.667
the popular song show made for
me, and by me, the Great Prussia!

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:39.583
Today we start right off
with some amazing guests!

00:07:39.583 --> 00:07:45.083
Believe it or not, we have Ukraine and
Belarus! They'll sing "Carrot and Stick"!

00:07:49.625 --> 00:07:51.875
"Carrot and... Stick"...

00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:54.542
Sorry. They canceled on us at the last minute.

00:07:54.542 --> 00:07:58.500
What?! Are all Russian stars like this?!

00:08:00.583 --> 00:08:02.083
I'm sorry!

00:08:02.083 --> 00:08:05.417
My breasts are so heavy that I have
terribly stiff shoulders, so I can't go!

00:08:05.417 --> 00:08:07.500
Big brother! Where are you?!

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.375
Where did you run off to, leaving me here?!

00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:15.167
<i>Hurry up and come out, or I will...</i>

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.250
Hetalia!

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.083
Hetalia.

00:08:17.083 --> 00:08:18.167
Hetalia.

00:09:02.083 --> 00:09:04.208
Okay! We'll make a sortie!

00:09:04.208 --> 00:09:07.458
As the heroes, we'll intercept their attack!

00:09:07.458 --> 00:09:09.083
Roger.

00:09:30.292 --> 00:09:31.500
Oh no...!

00:09:32.792 --> 00:09:36.000
I'm not going to let
them come close to my place.

00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:39.333
Kol, kol...

00:09:39.333 --> 00:09:40.750
"Red Cliffs"

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:43.000
We'll stop them at the Red Cliffs!

00:09:44.292 --> 00:09:47.917
<i>Ai ya</i>! I won't accept that this is happening!

00:09:49.458 --> 00:09:52.375
You bastard! Don't
underestimate a former pirate!

00:09:55.042 --> 00:09:59.208
What's with those <i>noppera</i>?
They're too tacky, aren't they?

00:09:59.208 --> 00:10:03.792
Big brother France will
elegantly take care of th--

00:10:03.792 --> 00:10:05.042
Argh!

00:10:05.958 --> 00:10:09.042
Listen! Don't let them
come close no matter what!

00:10:09.042 --> 00:10:10.667
Yes sir!

00:10:12.292 --> 00:10:13.917
So they're here...

00:10:22.542 --> 00:10:25.583
Germany! Germany! Protect us! Protect us!

00:10:25.583 --> 00:10:28.167
We all fled!

00:10:31.958 --> 00:10:34.500
Mr. Germany! There's trouble!
Our enemy is making a raid!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.125
What?!

00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:46.833
That was a prank by a monster called <i>mujina</i>.

00:10:46.833 --> 00:10:51.542
Oh... I sort of remember that
story was in an English textbook.

00:10:52.083 --> 00:10:56.208
Well... but we can't just leave things as is...

00:10:56.208 --> 00:10:58.000
Hmm...

00:11:00.958 --> 00:11:04.417
Well then, let's continue
this matter on another day.

00:11:06.417 --> 00:11:09.083
Ahh... But nothing has been decided yet...

00:11:10.333 --> 00:11:14.875
What's with this town?!
More importantly, where's Veneziano?!

00:11:14.875 --> 00:11:16.500
Where is he?!

00:11:17.792 --> 00:11:23.125
Ah! Pony! Where have you been?!
Seriously, I've looked all over for you.

00:11:23.125 --> 00:11:26.250
Hm? Wait... You look a little different...

00:11:29.292 --> 00:11:31.583
Ahh...

00:11:31.583 --> 00:11:34.208
I can't wait for Christmas.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.292
<i>Moi moi</i>.

00:11:39.542 --> 00:11:42.083
I'm hungry, aren't you?

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:45.917
Big brother... I am... happy.

00:12:47.958 --> 00:12:50.292
I see... Is that so...

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.417
"Permanent Neutrality Barrier"

00:13:10.417 --> 00:13:11.625
Hetalia!

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:14.917
Now, let's start the meeting to
discuss bringing down the Axis of Evil.

00:13:14.917 --> 00:13:16.958
I'm the moderator, so listen to me carefully.

00:13:16.958 --> 00:13:19.708
Really, it's annoying that huge
sausage-loving bastard started all this racket.

00:13:19.708 --> 00:13:21.958
Well, I bet he's deeply in love with Italy.
He's probably chasing after good

00:13:21.958 --> 00:13:24.625
