great about his butt? Really, I'm at a loss.

00:13:24.625 --> 00:13:28.500
Hey! I can't hear what you're saying.
Don't eat while you're talking.

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:30.958
Oh yeah. Since you're stupid,

00:13:30.958 --> 00:13:34.250
