you can understand what I'm saying.

00:13:35.583 --> 00:13:36.667
"Slurp"

00:13:36.667 --> 00:13:38.875
So, I thought about it... I think...

00:13:41.833 --> 00:13:43.167
In other words, I'm the hero!

00:13:43.167 --> 00:13:43.875
Shut up!

00:13:43.875 --> 00:13:44.875
Hetalia!

00:13:48.417 --> 00:13:49.708
"A certain day of a certain month"

00:13:49.708 --> 00:13:51.833
"A certain day of a certain month"
"Above the Russian border"

00:13:54.042 --> 00:13:55.833
Let me see...

00:13:55.833 --> 00:13:59.208
So all I have to do is jump off the
plane and make an assault on them, right?

00:13:59.208 --> 00:14:01.875
That's right. Put a parachute on.

00:14:01.875 --> 00:14:06.875
