00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.792
"A cat's tongue feels rough!"

00:15:14.833 --> 00:15:15.833
Hetalia.

00:15:15.917 --> 00:15:16.875
Count off!

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:17.667
One!

00:15:17.667 --> 00:15:18.208
Two!

00:15:18.208 --> 00:15:20.000
All right! We're halfway through our training.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:22.875
Brace your spirits and do
your best all the way to the end!

00:15:22.875 --> 00:15:24.500
Yes sir!

00:15:37.083 --> 00:15:42.542
