00:19:11.208 --> 00:19:12.458
Fucking!

00:19:12.458 --> 00:19:14.458
"The World of Picto Planet"

00:19:14.458 --> 00:19:16.583
"The World of Picto Planet"

00:19:23.042 --> 00:19:28.625
<i>This pure white planet is</i>
<i>their planet, the planet Picto.</i>

00:19:28.625 --> 00:19:30.667
<i>It is quite an evolved planet.</i>

00:19:30.667 --> 00:19:32.708
<i>The inhabitants there are planning to change</i>

00:19:32.708 --> 00:19:37.208
<i>all the planets in the</i>
<i>galaxy to be just like theirs.</i>

00:19:37.208 --> 00:19:39.083
<i>It's an annoying planet.</i>

00:19:39.083 --> 00:19:40.667
It's unforgivable!

00:19:40.667 --> 00:19:46.458
<i>And, they chose the Earth</i>
<i>as their first target to attack.</i>

00:19:46.458 --> 00:19:51.083
<i>It's widely rumored that</i>
<i>the reason for this is because</i>

00:19:51.083 --> 00:19:53.875
<i>"it's the most behind the times planet."</i>

00:19:53.875 --> 00:19:58.958
<i>Well, if you look at the space ranking,</i>
<i>it's so obvious the Earth is out of touch.</i>

00:19:58.958 --> 00:20:02.292
<i>And like, that planet is famous for</i>
<i>being disorganized and lacking unity.</i>

00:20:02.292 --> 00:20:05.583
<i>Well, there seems to be more reasons,</i>
<i>but I think it's better you not hear them</i>

00:20:05.583 --> 00:20:08.750
<i>because they'll bum you out...</i>
<i>Because they'll bum you out.</i>

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.000
Well, sorry that our
planet is behind the times.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.458
Kol, kol.

00:20:16.417 --> 00:20:17.792
Fucking.

00:20:17.792 --> 00:20:19.333
What did he say this time?!

00:20:19.333 --> 00:20:22.875
The more evolved the planet is, the
more <i>noppera </i>the people's faces are.

00:20:22.875 --> 00:20:26.875
I see... That's one planet that's
thinking something very unique.

00:20:26.875 --> 00:20:28.583
Don't they have some weaknesses?

00:20:28.583 --> 00:20:29.458
They do.

00:20:29.458 --> 00:20:30.458
What?!

00:20:30.458 --> 00:20:32.917
Hey! If you can speak our language,
you should've spoken already!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.625
Let's see... their weaknesses are...

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:50.958
"Everyone's healing place"
"Café Spain"

00:20:50.958 --> 00:20:54.458
Hello! This is a commercial for Café Spain!

00:20:54.458 --> 00:20:55.667
Watching movies is good, too,

00:20:55.667 --> 00:20:57.625
but come and have some
coffee at my café once in a while...

00:20:57.625 --> 00:20:59.458
although I've only got instant coffee.

00:20:59.458 --> 00:21:02.542
Believe it or not, I'm giving out a
special T-shirt to everyone right now!

00:21:02.542 --> 00:21:03.542
Hetalia!

00:21:03.542 --> 00:21:04.542
Hetalia.

00:21:05.792 --> 00:21:07.875
Their weaknesses...

00:21:30.333 --> 00:21:31.958
Tony!

00:22:06.458 --> 00:22:08.208
What on earth...

00:22:08.208 --> 00:22:10.250
It's growing rapidly!

00:22:27.125 --> 00:22:28.375
Don't tell me this is...

00:22:28.375 --> 00:22:30.083
Their mother ship?!

00:22:40.042 --> 00:22:42.708
Ahh! Help!

00:23:00.167 --> 00:23:02.167
Th-This is...

00:23:02.167 --> 00:23:04.750
Their mother ship?

00:23:05.792 --> 00:23:09.083
It's somehow what you'd expect!

00:23:09.083 --> 00:23:11.000
Look at that!

00:23:48.083 --> 00:23:50.208
Hey! They're going inside!

00:23:50.208 --> 00:23:52.750
I bet they're picking them up.

00:23:52.750 --> 00:23:56.792
They might be trying to fly out the
earthlings who became <i>noppera</i>.

00:23:56.792 --> 00:24:00.375
Nonsense! There's no way I'd allow that!

00:24:00.375 --> 00:24:02.750
I'm going to fight!

00:24:02.750 --> 00:24:04.458
Please wait, Mr. Germany.

00:24:04.458 --> 00:24:07.458
If we fight sporadically,
we'll just all end up defeated.

00:24:07.458 --> 00:24:09.625
--But...!
--We'll infiltrate the ship!

00:24:09.625 --> 00:24:12.792
We'll infiltrate the ship
to find their weaknesses!

00:24:12.792 --> 00:24:15.458
Whoa! An intelligence war, huh?!

00:24:15.458 --> 00:24:17.125
When it comes to spying, leave it to me.

00:24:17.125 --> 00:24:19.625
Nothing ventured, nothing gained, huh?

00:24:19.625 --> 00:24:20.958
But how?

00:24:20.958 --> 00:24:24.375
I've got a good idea.

00:24:24.375 --> 00:24:26.000
Tada!

00:24:26.000 --> 00:24:27.958
What the hell is that?!

00:24:27.958 --> 00:24:30.792
A Pictonian costume.

00:24:30.792 --> 00:24:33.875
I made this yesterday using
the cloth I keep for white flags.

00:24:33.875 --> 00:24:37.208
Ah! I've got one for everyone!

00:24:46.250 --> 00:24:47.708
All right!

00:24:47.708 --> 00:24:49.375
Charge!

00:24:49.375 --> 00:24:50.625
This is where the hero comes in!

00:24:50.625 --> 00:24:52.833
--Mission start!
--I'm gonna go elegantly!

00:24:52.833 --> 00:24:53.833
Leave things to me!

00:24:53.833 --> 00:24:54.542
Kol, kol.

00:24:54.542 --> 00:24:56.750
Now, into battle!

00:24:56.750 --> 00:24:58.125
See you later!

00:24:58.125 --> 00:25:00.500
Hey! You're coming, too!

00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:03.167
What? I don't want to. I'm scared.

00:25:03.167 --> 00:25:06.542
To be honest, I didn't make
the costumes for that purpose.

00:25:06.542 --> 00:25:09.375
It was just a joke! A joke!

00:25:10.583 --> 00:25:12.292
Then, stay here alone.

00:25:12.292 --> 00:25:14.125
What?!

00:25:15.500 --> 00:25:20.333
Being alone is worse!

00:25:52.250 --> 00:25:53.208
Hetalia!

00:25:54.958 --> 00:26:00.167
England... There's something
I have to say to you.

00:26:00.167 --> 00:26:03.417
Will you... marry me?

00:26:03.417 --> 00:26:04.833
Huh?

00:26:05.917 --> 00:26:10.375
H-Hey, France. Today isn't April Fools' Day.

00:26:11.583 --> 00:26:12.958
"Gloomy"
Wh-What's the matter?

00:26:12.958 --> 00:26:15.458
Are you in such trouble that
you can't even buy a calendar?

00:26:16.125 --> 00:26:19.708
I can manage to buy things like a calendar.

00:26:19.708 --> 00:26:21.667
What's with that weak reaction?

00:26:21.667 --> 00:26:23.292
Here.

00:26:23.458 --> 00:26:24.292
"Marriage Registration Form"

00:26:24.292 --> 00:26:26.833
That's a marriage registration form, you idiot!

00:26:28.833 --> 00:26:31.792
No, this is a calendar!

00:26:31.792 --> 00:26:33.542
Wh-What?!

00:26:33.542 --> 00:26:35.958
This is a calendar!

00:26:35.958 --> 00:26:39.292
France! Hey, you're
scary today for some reason!

00:26:39.292 --> 00:26:43.042
Hey! Why are you making me
sign the marriage registration form?!

00:26:43.042 --> 00:26:44.625
Stop it!

00:26:45.458 --> 00:26:48.333
Hey! What're you doing, France?!

00:26:48.333 --> 00:26:51.458
There's no other choice, is there?!
I don't wanna do this, either!

00:26:51.458 --> 00:26:55.417
But my house is in a pretty big slump
due to the Suez Canal matter right now.

00:26:55.417 --> 00:27:01.250
I-I-If I don't get married with you
now, I might die! My boss said so!

00:27:01.250 --> 00:27:03.792
You might die!

00:27:03.792 --> 00:27:06.292
I don't want to get
married for a reason like that!

00:27:06.292 --> 00:27:07.458
Here's what I'll do...

00:27:07.458 --> 00:27:08.667
to this form!

00:27:08.667 --> 00:27:10.833
Ahh! What're you doing?!

00:27:10.833 --> 00:27:14.792
That serves you right! You don't force
people to sign a marriage registration!

00:27:16.000 --> 00:27:19.500
You brute! Devil!
Don't you even care if I die?

00:27:19.500 --> 00:27:22.250
Hey, seriously, I'm begging you, England.

00:27:22.250 --> 00:27:25.333
I can become England's
France Village or whatever!

00:27:25.333 --> 00:27:26.792
Please help me!

00:27:26.792 --> 00:27:29.542
I won't, you idiot!
Why would I marry <i>you</i>?!

00:27:29.542 --> 00:27:33.333
First and foremost, you have to
deal with your own failures yourse--

00:27:37.333 --> 00:27:40.750
Let me go! H-Hey, what
do you think you're doing?!

00:27:40.750 --> 00:27:41.833
Are you listening?! Hey, France! Hold on! Hey!

00:27:41.833 --> 00:27:44.958
"Drag, drag"
Are you listening?! Hey, France! Hold on! Hey!

00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:47.083
"Merger of England and France"

00:27:47.083 --> 00:27:49.083
"While there was a growing sense of
crisis due to the Suez Crisis in 1956,

00:27:49.083 --> 00:27:51.083
then French Prime Minister Guy
Mollet suggested to England

00:27:51.083 --> 00:27:53.083
that England and France merge, saying that
they would agree to have Queen Elizabeth

00:27:53.083 --> 00:27:55.083
be the united sovereign.
Even after being summarily turned down,

00:27:55.083 --> 00:27:57.042
he requested for France to join
the Commonwealth of Nations."

00:27:57.042 --> 00:28:00.458
"Well, if you think about it,
that'd be... impossible."

00:28:00.583 --> 00:28:05.250
Ahh, It'll be fine. I can manage. I can do it.

00:28:05.250 --> 00:28:08.125
It'll be fine. It'll be fine.

00:28:08.167 --> 00:28:09.125
Hetalia.

00:28:09.167 --> 00:28:12.750
Eh... Hmm...

00:28:12.750 --> 00:28:15.250
Italy, what're you looking at?

00:28:15.250 --> 00:28:18.625
Oh, this? My combat record.

00:28:25.625 --> 00:28:26.583
Hetalia.

00:28:26.583 --> 00:28:26.917
"APH News"

00:28:26.917 --> 00:28:28.125
"APH News"
Now for the news.

00:28:28.125 --> 00:28:30.208
While the entire world is in crisis,

00:28:30.208 --> 00:28:32.917
believe it or not, Cuba and
Canada have joined hands

00:28:32.917 --> 00:28:37.208
and are helping those
injured by the Picto beam.

00:28:37.208 --> 00:28:38.750
My legs...! My legs...!

00:28:38.750 --> 00:28:39.667
My arms...!

00:28:39.667 --> 00:28:41.667
Hang in there! It's only half way!

00:28:41.667 --> 00:28:43.083
It's only half way.

00:28:43.208 --> 00:28:44.500
"Q. Is there something you
felt while helping people out?"

00:28:44.500 --> 00:28:49.208
Yes. It's a very fulfilling feeling,
being able to help someone.

00:28:49.208 --> 00:28:49.708
Who are you?

00:28:49.708 --> 00:28:50.792
I'm Canada.

00:28:50.792 --> 00:28:51.750
Hetalia.

00:28:51.750 --> 00:28:52.625
Hetalia!

00:28:52.625 --> 00:28:53.792
Hetalia.

00:29:12.042 --> 00:29:14.292
All right! Follow my instructions!

00:29:14.292 --> 00:29:17.458
Russia, back me up. China, back me up.

00:29:17.458 --> 00:29:19.500
France and England, back me up.

00:29:19.500 --> 00:29:21.583
Germany... Hm?

00:29:21.583 --> 00:29:23.792
We'll split into three groups
using lots and then go search.

00:29:23.792 --> 00:29:25.500
Hey! You're ignoring me?!

00:29:28.375 --> 00:29:30.458
Damn! So I end up
teaming up with you after all.

00:29:30.458 --> 00:29:32.333
Shut up! That's my line, you idiot!

00:29:32.333 --> 00:29:34.333
Shh!

00:29:34.333 --> 00:29:35.917
This way!

00:29:53.917 --> 00:29:55.542
That was close, wasn't it?

00:29:55.542 --> 00:29:58.458
Ha! They're not gonna find us so easily!

00:29:58.458 --> 00:30:01.333
Okay then. Let's go find
their information room!

00:30:01.333 --> 00:30:03.958
Humph! Don't boss me around, you idiot!

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:08.333
In any case, let's find this ship's cockpit!

00:30:08.333 --> 00:30:11.250
We'll destroy the switch for the Picto beam.

00:30:19.542 --> 00:30:21.542
Let's go boldly and fearlessly.

00:30:25.542 --> 00:30:27.292
--Huh?
<i>--Ai ya</i>!

00:30:36.250 --> 00:30:38.958
Geez, so they can't tell we're different?

00:30:40.667 --> 00:30:42.875
Hey, where are we going?

00:30:42.875 --> 00:30:45.625
We'll go rescue the earthlings
who got turned into Pictonians!

00:30:45.625 --> 00:30:49.000
There's got to be a housing facility somewhere.

00:30:57.792 --> 00:31:00.125
A whole bunch of them are coming!

00:31:01.000 --> 00:31:03.083
Mr. Germany! Look over there!

00:31:13.458 --> 00:31:16.083
Looks like that's the information room.

00:31:16.083 --> 00:31:17.833
All right! Let's hurry!

00:31:26.167 --> 00:31:27.875
What's this globe?

00:31:27.875 --> 00:31:30.667
Well, it's probably information
on their progress in the battle.

00:31:30.667 --> 00:31:32.917
So the areas in white are
where they've already attacked

00:31:32.917 --> 00:31:35.667
and the red dots are where
they're attacking right now?

00:31:43.042 --> 00:31:44.417
What's this?!

00:31:44.417 --> 00:31:46.125
It must be their language.

00:31:46.125 --> 00:31:48.125
Okay, let's translate it.

00:31:50.125 --> 00:31:51.375
"England.

00:31:51.375 --> 00:31:55.625
A former pirate, but now a
gentlemanly empire with lots of rain.

00:31:55.625 --> 00:31:58.333
Cynical and hates to lose.

00:31:58.333 --> 00:32:01.292
France is a long time friend
he's always bickering with.

00:32:01.292 --> 00:32:05.667
However, in the back of their
minds, they accept each other."

00:32:05.667 --> 00:32:08.208
Oh... I see...

00:32:08.208 --> 00:32:11.750
Hey, there's no way that's true!

00:32:11.750 --> 00:32:14.750
--I'd never accept you!
--Same here! I'd never...

00:32:17.417 --> 00:32:20.417
Hey, looks like this is
no time to have a quarrel.

00:32:20.417 --> 00:32:22.125
Yeah...

00:32:22.125 --> 00:32:23.625
But not to worry!

00:32:23.625 --> 00:32:28.375
In a case like this, there's
always a hidden door somewhere.

00:32:28.375 --> 00:32:29.792
Ah! Here it is!

00:32:29.792 --> 00:32:31.417
Huh?

00:32:31.417 --> 00:32:32.750
Umph!

00:32:35.333 --> 00:32:36.375
I knew it!

00:32:36.375 --> 00:32:38.583
Don't say, "I knew it!"

00:32:51.583 --> 00:32:53.167
There's no one here.

00:32:53.167 --> 00:32:55.875
I bet it's break time.

00:32:55.875 --> 00:32:59.958
Okay then! Let's find the
beam shooting lever while we can!

00:33:02.792 --> 00:33:06.417
But I can't make these switches
out, any one of them could be it.

00:33:06.417 --> 00:33:08.042
Yeah, you're right.

00:33:08.042 --> 00:33:09.875
Isn't this the one?

00:33:16.542 --> 00:33:17.667
This one.

00:33:17.667 --> 00:33:20.792
Hmm, it certainly does look like it, but...

00:33:20.792 --> 00:33:23.417
It's more like it looks so
certain that it's suspicious.

00:33:23.417 --> 00:33:27.250
Surely the floor wouldn't fall as
soon as we pull the lever, right?

00:33:45.792 --> 00:33:46.750
This is bad!

00:33:46.750 --> 00:33:48.125
Let's get out of here!

00:34:00.083 --> 00:34:03.042
What's going on? There's
quite a commotion outside.

00:34:03.042 --> 00:34:06.875
Could it be that something
happened to the others?

00:34:10.083 --> 00:34:13.167
What the hell, Italy?! When'd
you sneak in something like that?!

00:34:13.167 --> 00:34:15.208
What? It somehow relaxes me, so...

00:34:15.208 --> 00:34:17.042
Don't relax!

00:34:21.625 --> 00:34:24.458
What's with them?! They're super persistent!

00:34:24.458 --> 00:34:26.500
I thought they couldn't tell we're different!

00:34:26.500 --> 00:34:28.792
I'm already tired.

00:34:44.125 --> 00:34:45.750
<i>Ai ya</i>!

00:34:59.583 --> 00:35:04.125
H-Hey! Because you guys jumped out
from a place like this at a time like that,

00:35:04.125 --> 00:35:06.250
we're very much cornered now!

00:35:06.250 --> 00:35:08.958
Shut up! Don't make it just our fault!

00:35:08.958 --> 00:35:12.708
That's right. If you hadn't
been running in a place like that...

00:35:12.708 --> 00:35:15.500
I don't think this is the time for an argument.

00:35:21.750 --> 00:35:23.458
Th-This is bad!

00:35:23.458 --> 00:35:25.458
The amount of light they're
emitting is rapidly increasing!

00:35:25.458 --> 00:35:27.958
Hey, hey... are we finally
going to be turned into <i>noppera</i>?

00:35:27.958 --> 00:35:32.750
Don't worry. I'm sure Germany
and the others will come rescue us.

00:35:54.833 --> 00:35:57.125
Hey! Stop it! Don't scratch me!

00:35:57.125 --> 00:36:00.333
Uhm, please don't go on a
rampage in a place like this.

00:36:13.292 --> 00:36:16.000
Far from coming to our rescue...

00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:19.083
They jumped into hell on their own.

00:36:20.208 --> 00:36:22.667
This is definitely it for us!
What're we going to do?!

00:36:33.458 --> 00:36:35.083
Big brother...?

00:36:39.292 --> 00:36:42.083
Yeah, this tastes good.

00:36:46.708 --> 00:36:48.792
Thank you very much.

00:36:55.208 --> 00:36:56.208
Hetalia!

00:36:56.750 --> 00:37:00.125
Germany! Germany! I wrote a song for you.

00:37:00.125 --> 00:37:03.958
Wha...? For me? Even though
I'm your enemy? Okay. Let me hear it.

00:37:04.375 --> 00:37:08.917
♪ Germany! Germany! Germany is a nice place! ♪

00:37:08.917 --> 00:37:11.375
♪ You Germans keep me
fed though I'm your prisoner. ♪

00:37:11.375 --> 00:37:14.042
♪ And your food isn't nasty like England's. ♪

00:37:14.042 --> 00:37:18.083
♪ Sausage, cheese... They taste really good! ♪

00:37:18.083 --> 00:37:22.458
♪ It's heaven for dogs. That's Germany. ♪

00:37:22.458 --> 00:37:25.792
♪ But why are all you Germans so rugged? ♪

00:37:25.792 --> 00:37:28.083
♪ The intimidation is crushing me.  ♪

00:37:28.083 --> 00:37:32.958
♪ My heart sheds tears out of fear.
And the women are big, too. ♪

00:37:32.958 --> 00:37:37.083
♪ Is busting beer barrels
every day your hobby? ♪

00:37:37.083 --> 00:37:39.458
♪ Also, please don't come
to my place in huge mobs. ♪

00:37:39.458 --> 00:37:41.292
♪ You German tourists are too scary. ♪

00:37:41.292 --> 00:37:47.042
♪ German girls are bigger
and stronger than I am. Yahoo! ♪

00:37:47.042 --> 00:37:48.292
Welcome home, Italy.

00:37:48.333 --> 00:37:49.292
Hetalia!

00:37:51.417 --> 00:37:52.625
Germany is strong!

00:37:52.625 --> 00:37:57.750
Dammit! I was beaten
by that [BEEP] Kraut again!

00:37:57.750 --> 00:38:03.083
I let him beat me without a fight
today, but next time won't be so easy.

00:38:03.083 --> 00:38:10.208
Unbeknownst to other countries,
I still have the strongest weapon left.

00:38:10.208 --> 00:38:12.958
Guys! We'll call down a curse
on Germany with all our might!

00:38:12.958 --> 00:38:14.708
Yeah!

00:38:16.292 --> 00:38:19.417
That stupid Germany will
cry and regret what he did.

00:38:19.417 --> 00:38:21.542
England! What're you doing?!

00:38:21.542 --> 00:38:23.125
Hey, why is America here?

00:38:23.125 --> 00:38:25.417
W-Welcome to the costume party!

00:38:25.417 --> 00:38:26.458
Hetalia!

00:38:27.000 --> 00:38:31.333
Dammit! Since I was interrupted
last time, I'll do it at my place this time.

00:38:31.333 --> 00:38:33.375
Our family's magic is No. 1 in the world.

00:38:33.375 --> 00:38:35.750
You're no match for me, you stupid America!

00:38:58.125 --> 00:39:00.875
I summon you from a far land.

00:39:00.875 --> 00:39:02.833
Now show yourself!

00:39:12.875 --> 00:39:14.500
You called?

00:39:23.167 --> 00:39:24.708
Damn Kolkhoz!

00:39:24.708 --> 00:39:25.708
Hetalia!

00:39:25.958 --> 00:39:30.625
Hey, hey, Germany! What're you
doing? Let's play football together!

00:39:30.625 --> 00:39:31.542
I'm reading.

00:39:31.542 --> 00:39:34.708
It's a beautiful day. So let's play football!

00:39:35.667 --> 00:39:39.458
Hey, Germany! Let's play football! Football!

00:39:39.458 --> 00:39:44.333
Hey! Football! Football! Germany! Germany!

00:39:44.333 --> 00:39:47.042
What're you trying to do?!

00:39:47.042 --> 00:39:48.042
Hetalia!

00:39:48.083 --> 00:39:50.875
Hey, Japan, about tonight's dinner...

00:39:50.875 --> 00:39:54.208
Yes, I'm cooking potatoes in broth, and
some edible plants from the mountains.

00:39:54.208 --> 00:39:58.167
I had beef stew one time at
England's house. I want to have it tonight.

00:39:58.167 --> 00:40:01.083
P-Please don't be so
unreasonable! I can't make that!

00:40:01.083 --> 00:40:02.708
I'm counting on you!

00:40:03.875 --> 00:40:05.917
After I went through the
trouble to cook potatoes in broth...

00:40:05.917 --> 00:40:08.042
How selfish that boss is.

00:40:08.042 --> 00:40:09.708
But I am a Japanese man.

00:40:09.708 --> 00:40:12.792
Even if it's something I can't cook,
I'll manage it with sheer willpower!

00:40:12.792 --> 00:40:16.875
To cook it, I'll need beef,
potatoes, carrots, and what else...

00:40:16.875 --> 00:40:18.125
<i>Konnyaku </i>noodles?

00:40:18.125 --> 00:40:21.417
If I remember correctly, it was brown,
so maybe soy sauce. And <i>mirin</i>, too.

00:40:21.417 --> 00:40:26.708
Oh no... The more I add things, the
more it looks like an unknown food!

00:40:26.708 --> 00:40:28.292
I-It's done!

00:40:28.292 --> 00:40:30.500
Whoa! Just as you'd expect from Japan!

00:40:30.500 --> 00:40:32.417
I'm really sorry.

00:40:32.417 --> 00:40:35.292
<i>This is the dish later known as nikujaga.</i>

00:40:35.292 --> 00:40:36.625
Munch, munch, much...

00:40:36.625 --> 00:40:37.375
"Big Discovery!!"
This is...

00:40:37.375 --> 00:40:38.333
"Big Discovery!!"
Delicious!

00:40:38.333 --> 00:40:39.458
"<i>Nikujaga</i>"

00:40:39.500 --> 00:40:40.500
Hetalia.

00:40:47.250 --> 00:40:51.083
Now that it's come to this,
there's no other choice!

00:40:51.083 --> 00:40:55.333
Pictonians! We've come
to show you our hospitality!

00:40:55.333 --> 00:40:56.667
What?

00:40:56.667 --> 00:40:57.667
Huh?

00:40:57.667 --> 00:41:01.042
Everyone, calm down
and think about it carefully.

00:41:01.042 --> 00:41:03.708
It's true that they came to invade the Earth,

00:41:03.708 --> 00:41:07.167
but they're our guests who came
from the faraway planet, Picto.

00:41:07.167 --> 00:41:09.500
It's very natural as a
Japanese--no, as an earthling

00:41:09.500 --> 00:41:13.000
to show hospitality to our guests!

00:41:13.000 --> 00:41:17.542
Now, let's hold a reception for the Pictonians!

00:41:17.542 --> 00:41:19.833
Reception?

00:41:19.833 --> 00:41:21.292
Hospi...

00:41:21.292 --> 00:41:25.125
...tality?

00:41:25.125 --> 00:41:26.708
Somehow...

00:41:26.708 --> 00:41:29.500
it seems kinda off, though...

00:41:29.500 --> 00:41:33.208
Okay then! At this point,
why don't we try anything?!

00:41:42.583 --> 00:41:44.708
"Chinatown"

00:41:44.708 --> 00:41:46.250
"Frenzied Welcome" "Chinatown"

00:41:46.250 --> 00:41:48.292
--When it comes to receptions, leave it to me!

00:41:48.292 --> 00:41:49.000
--Meat Bun!
--When it comes to receptions, leave it to me!

00:41:49.000 --> 00:41:49.958
<i>--Shumai</i>!
--When it comes to receptions, leave it to me!

00:41:52.125 --> 00:41:55.583
Now, go ahead and eat a lot!

00:41:55.583 --> 00:41:58.792
Hey, you'd actually build
a town on a spaceship, too?!

00:42:07.042 --> 00:42:09.083
How is it? Is it delicious?

00:42:09.083 --> 00:42:13.042
There's plenty, so go ahead and eat freely!

00:42:13.042 --> 00:42:14.625
Okay!

00:42:14.625 --> 00:42:16.375
It's not for you to eat!

00:42:34.292 --> 00:42:40.167
Ladies and gentlemen! Are you enjoying
this to the fullest?! Do you like it?!

00:42:48.625 --> 00:42:50.708
Not sure...

00:42:50.708 --> 00:42:54.250
Really?! Not sure?!

00:42:54.250 --> 00:42:55.208
What?

00:42:55.208 --> 00:42:57.708
Not sure...?

00:42:57.708 --> 00:43:01.583
Does that mean the food was delicious?

00:43:03.583 --> 00:43:05.417
Not sure...

00:43:07.750 --> 00:43:10.417
<i>Ai ya</i>!

00:43:11.167 --> 00:43:12.625
"Crushing Defeat"

00:43:12.792 --> 00:43:15.125
Hi!

00:43:15.125 --> 00:43:18.583
It's my turn to show my hospitality!

00:43:18.583 --> 00:43:23.792
On my honor as a representative
of Europe, I'll satisfy you all!

00:43:29.458 --> 00:43:34.583
A full-course dinner from a three-star
restaurant along with the finest wine...

00:43:34.583 --> 00:43:37.750
Experience supreme bliss.

00:43:37.750 --> 00:43:38.583
Okay!

00:43:38.583 --> 00:43:41.083
I told you it's not for you!

00:43:51.167 --> 00:43:56.125
How is it? Do you like it, monsieur?

00:43:59.583 --> 00:44:01.208
Not sure...

00:44:02.750 --> 00:44:04.833
Why?!

00:44:06.083 --> 00:44:07.458
"Defeated"

00:44:07.917 --> 00:44:11.042
Then, it's my turn next, right?

00:44:11.042 --> 00:44:12.917
I'm counting on you.

00:44:12.917 --> 00:44:14.625
Yes sir.

00:44:20.083 --> 00:44:27.667
Excuse me, but can this
really be considered hospitality?

00:44:27.667 --> 00:44:29.500
Of course!

00:44:29.500 --> 00:44:30.417
Right?

00:44:30.417 --> 00:44:31.625
What?

00:44:32.750 --> 00:44:35.042
Err...

00:44:39.833 --> 00:44:42.208
Not sure...

00:44:42.208 --> 00:44:44.417
We're going back.

00:44:48.792 --> 00:44:52.458
Kol, kol, kol, kol, kol...

00:44:52.458 --> 00:44:56.083
Okay then! I'll show my hospitality this time!

00:45:01.000 --> 00:45:10.000
Th-Th-This is... G-G-Germany's good...
b-b-beer. W-Well, h-have some.

00:45:11.375 --> 00:45:13.000
Hospitality...

00:45:20.583 --> 00:45:24.250
You look nervous.

00:45:24.250 --> 00:45:29.083
Ladies and gentlemen! And Pictonians!

00:45:29.083 --> 00:45:31.417
When people hear the word
"entertainment," they think of me!

00:45:31.417 --> 00:45:36.625
And the hospitality
that I'll show you is... this!

00:45:46.333 --> 00:46:04.042
Not sure... Not sure... Not sure... Not sure...

00:46:04.042 --> 00:46:05.167
Smooch!

00:46:05.167 --> 00:46:07.583
Not sure!

00:46:07.583 --> 00:46:11.833
Whoa! I'll say it, too!
Not sure! Not sure! Not sure!

00:46:11.833 --> 00:46:15.750
All right! For some reason
or another, it's getting lively!

00:46:15.750 --> 00:46:19.417
All I have to do now is bring them
into the VIP room and let them win big.

00:46:19.417 --> 00:46:21.500
And then when they're very
pleased, I'll have them sign

00:46:21.500 --> 00:46:23.292
this peace treaty without thinking!

00:46:23.292 --> 00:46:26.333
No, it's still too early to do that.

00:46:26.333 --> 00:46:30.917
Bringing up the main subject at this
time is something an amateur would do.

00:46:30.917 --> 00:46:35.583
I'm a pro at receptions. Leave it to me now!

00:46:35.583 --> 00:46:37.833
I-Is that right?

00:46:44.833 --> 00:46:50.833
Pictonians! This is a Japanese <i>bon</i>
dancing festival! Let's dance together!

00:46:59.333 --> 00:47:04.375
Whoa! Me, too! Me, too!

00:47:04.375 --> 00:47:06.083
It's fun, isn't it?!

00:47:06.083 --> 00:47:07.958
Not sure... Not sure...

00:47:07.958 --> 00:47:10.292
All right, Japan! Have them
sign this! Have them sign this!

00:47:10.292 --> 00:47:11.625
No, not yet!

00:47:11.625 --> 00:47:15.875
For now, we'll give them gifts and see
them off while they're feeling cheerful.

00:47:15.875 --> 00:47:18.500
And then, we'll discuss it on a later day.

00:47:18.500 --> 00:47:21.208
That's the secret to successful receptions!

00:47:21.208 --> 00:47:23.417
I-Is that right?

00:47:23.417 --> 00:47:25.500
If you're talking about gifts, I prepared them.

00:47:25.500 --> 00:47:28.875
Whoa! You're tactful, England!

00:47:28.875 --> 00:47:30.750
--Thank you very much.
--Not sure... Not sure... Not sure...

00:47:30.750 --> 00:47:33.125
--Not sure... Not sure... Not sure...

00:47:33.125 --> 00:47:36.625
All right! They look super happy.

00:47:36.625 --> 00:47:39.542
By the way, Mr. England, what's in those bags?

00:47:39.542 --> 00:47:42.500
What else?! Of course, it's
scones specially made by me!

00:47:42.500 --> 00:47:45.667
What...? What?!

00:47:47.708 --> 00:47:49.667
Seriously?!

00:47:49.667 --> 00:47:52.500
Seriously...? Seriously...? Seriously...?

00:47:52.500 --> 00:47:54.458
What? What is it?

00:48:03.667 --> 00:48:07.167
L-Looks like it's turning out quite bad.

00:48:07.917 --> 00:48:09.958
What? Why?

00:48:11.792 --> 00:48:12.958
Oh?

00:48:12.958 --> 00:48:15.792
What's the matter, everyone?! Let's play more!

00:48:15.792 --> 00:48:19.833
Let's have more and more fun! Okay?!

00:48:19.833 --> 00:48:20.750
Oh no...

00:48:20.750 --> 00:48:22.125
Oh no...

00:48:22.125 --> 00:48:25.375
Oh no... Oh no... Oh no...

00:48:25.375 --> 00:48:27.333
Wh-What's wrong? What happened?

00:48:27.333 --> 00:48:28.208
Beats me.

00:48:28.208 --> 00:48:30.917
I don't know what's going
on, but for now, retreat!

00:48:30.917 --> 00:48:32.542
Agreed!

00:48:35.167 --> 00:48:38.375
What?! Wait for me!

00:49:20.167 --> 00:49:21.167
Hetalia.

00:49:22.875 --> 00:49:25.958
Ahh... As I thought, I can't do it!

00:49:25.958 --> 00:49:28.458
What're you saying, Mr. Austria!

00:49:28.458 --> 00:49:31.208
There's no music that you can't create!

00:49:31.208 --> 00:49:35.167
But I've never heard
Japanese dance music properly,

00:49:35.167 --> 00:49:38.875
not to mention... I've never
done <i>bon </i>dancing, either.

00:49:40.958 --> 00:49:44.583
Why did Mr. Japan ask me
to do something like this?

00:49:44.583 --> 00:49:46.167
Mr. Austria...

00:49:46.167 --> 00:49:47.167
Hetalia!

00:49:47.917 --> 00:49:50.542
Well, then. I'm going to Russia.

00:49:50.542 --> 00:49:52.333
So make sure you take care
of things while I'm gone, okay?

00:49:52.333 --> 00:49:55.750
Oh no! I don't wanna be alone!

00:50:00.167 --> 00:50:02.833
It's scary to be alone. Don't leave me here.

00:50:02.833 --> 00:50:07.417
I'm afraid of England and France.
I'll be beaten up if I'm by myself!

00:50:08.792 --> 00:50:12.208
But I'm not gonna be
dependent on Germany forever!

00:50:12.208 --> 00:50:15.000
I'll show them the spirit of Italy!

00:50:15.000 --> 00:50:16.417
Hm?

00:50:16.417 --> 00:50:24.250
Flap, flap, flap, flap...

00:50:24.250 --> 00:50:27.833
The spirit of Italy!

00:50:27.833 --> 00:50:28.833
Hetalia!

00:50:28.833 --> 00:50:32.667
We finally invented a machine
that can make perfect boiled eggs!

00:50:32.667 --> 00:50:34.833
It's a state-of-the-art boiled
egg manufacturing machine that

00:50:34.833 --> 00:50:37.667
we, the British Empire,
marshaled our intelligence to create.

00:50:37.667 --> 00:50:40.542
We spent several years on the
concept and its development took...

00:50:40.542 --> 00:50:44.292
So... our long years of effort were
worth it and now we can make delicious

00:50:44.292 --> 00:50:48.333
boiled eggs by using technologies
that no other country can imitate.

00:50:52.250 --> 00:50:53.125
Hetalia!

00:50:53.250 --> 00:50:56.042
We finally invented a machine that
can release beer foam without a mess.

00:50:56.042 --> 00:50:58.958
Clink.

00:50:58.958 --> 00:51:01.542
You bastard! There's no need
to hit me with the beer, is there?!

00:51:01.542 --> 00:51:03.750
Yes, there is!

00:51:03.750 --> 00:51:06.167
It's another peaceful day
today for the Allied countries.

00:51:06.208 --> 00:51:07.167
Hetalia.

00:51:07.250 --> 00:51:09.000
"How to Get Along with Italians: Brothers"
Hey, you potato jerk!

00:51:09.000 --> 00:51:10.875
"How to Get Along with Italians: Brothers"
Be surprised when I tell you this, you jerk!

00:51:10.875 --> 00:51:13.167
What now? Make it quick.

00:51:13.167 --> 00:51:19.375
Listen up. I brought a secret
weapon today to get my revenge!

00:51:19.375 --> 00:51:21.000
Tada!

00:51:23.500 --> 00:51:26.792
You look tacky! It looks
like you have a mustache!

00:51:26.792 --> 00:51:30.125
A potato jerk with a mustache
looks hilarious, you jerk!

00:51:30.125 --> 00:51:32.958
It looks like you have a
mustache, too, from this side.

00:51:32.958 --> 00:51:36.708
What? Really? D-Don't look!
Don't look at me! Dammit!

00:51:36.792 --> 00:51:37.708
Hetalia!

00:51:38.208 --> 00:51:42.417
<i>Due to my merger with Austria,</i>
<i>he started living at my house.</i>

00:51:42.417 --> 00:51:45.958
<i>Every day since then, I don't want to</i>
<i>go home even though I'm not married.</i>

00:51:45.958 --> 00:51:49.833
Hey! Why do you so easily ditch your
underwear when you can still wear it?!

00:51:49.833 --> 00:51:54.083
If Franz Joseph I sees this, he'd die in
a fit of anger at you being too wasteful!

00:51:54.083 --> 00:51:56.000
Well, but it has a hole.

00:51:56.000 --> 00:52:01.500
This little hole?! Joseph
I wouldn't care about it! You dummy!

00:52:01.500 --> 00:52:07.208
<i>After all... I ended up having to</i>
<i>continue wearing the underwear he patched.</i>

00:52:07.208 --> 00:52:08.208
Hetalia.

00:52:09.292 --> 00:52:11.875
<i>"Month: oo, Day: xx, Sunny.</i>

00:52:11.875 --> 00:52:15.500
<i>That darn Italy skipped</i>
<i>out on his training again."</i>

00:52:15.667 --> 00:52:20.042
Ahh... Germany is awfully
fired up and scary today.

00:52:21.250 --> 00:52:22.417
Hm?

00:52:22.417 --> 00:52:25.042
Whoa! How cute!

00:52:25.042 --> 00:52:28.417
I wonder if her living here
means she's Germany's cat.

00:52:28.417 --> 00:52:31.375
I wish Germany were cute like her.

00:52:31.375 --> 00:52:34.208
The kitty's cute! Kitty! Kitty! Kitty!

00:52:34.208 --> 00:52:36.375
She's cute! Cute!

00:52:37.625 --> 00:52:40.667
Sorry, but I can't be like her.

00:52:40.667 --> 00:52:45.375
Mew! G-Germany!

00:52:45.417 --> 00:52:46.375
Hetalia!

00:52:57.125 --> 00:53:00.125
<i>I wonder how long it's been since then...</i>

00:53:00.125 --> 00:53:03.708
<i>When I noticed, I had</i>
<i>washed ashore on the beach,</i>

00:53:03.708 --> 00:53:09.833
<i>and now, I'm wandering in a</i>
<i>jungle with no idea where I'm headed.</i>

00:53:11.542 --> 00:53:14.250
<i>Since that time, I got</i>
<i>separated from the others,</i>

00:53:14.250 --> 00:53:17.000
<i>and I don't know if they're okay or not.</i>

00:53:17.000 --> 00:53:19.458
<i>No, what's even worse,</i>

00:53:19.458 --> 00:53:23.042
<i>I don't even know what's happening on Earth.</i>

00:53:24.500 --> 00:53:30.208
<i>I wonder if it has all been</i>
<i>transformed to be like the Picto planet.</i>

00:53:30.208 --> 00:53:32.208
<i>If that's the case...</i>

00:53:33.917 --> 00:53:38.375
<i>...this place is the last stronghold...</i>

00:53:38.375 --> 00:53:40.000
<i>But...</i>

00:53:44.417 --> 00:53:49.292
<i>...as might be expected, even my physical</i>
<i>strength seems to have reached its limit.</i>

00:53:49.292 --> 00:53:51.583
<i>I wouldn't even ask for beer...</i>

00:53:51.583 --> 00:53:55.458
<i>If only there was some</i>
<i>water to moisten my throat...</i>

00:53:55.458 --> 00:53:57.833
<i>I wouldn't even ask for wurst...</i>

00:53:57.833 --> 00:54:01.625
<i>If only there was some</i>
<i>food to satisfy my hunger...</i>

00:54:16.792 --> 00:54:20.500
Wh-What was that light I just saw?

00:54:20.500 --> 00:54:22.500
Is someone there?

00:54:51.208 --> 00:54:54.292
I-Italy? He's...

00:54:54.292 --> 00:54:57.708
That is, indeed, the light of hope, isn't it?

00:54:57.708 --> 00:55:01.083
Oh, I can finally eat...

00:55:03.208 --> 00:55:04.625
You guys...

00:55:17.167 --> 00:55:18.792
Yeah...

00:55:32.167 --> 00:55:34.792
Guys! I was waiting for you guys!

00:55:34.792 --> 00:55:38.000
The pasta will be ready soon, okay?!

00:55:40.208 --> 00:55:43.042
Hello, everyone!

00:55:53.875 --> 00:55:56.458
It's me, Sealand!

00:55:56.458 --> 00:55:59.708
I found your whereabouts
using the Internet, my specialty,

00:55:59.708 --> 00:56:03.000
and came with my entire land to rescue you!

00:56:03.000 --> 00:56:07.417
You don't have to! You'll become
a burden instead, right, you idiot?!

00:56:07.417 --> 00:56:10.167
<i>I'll use this chance to rescue big countries</i>

00:56:10.167 --> 00:56:13.167
<i>and have them accept me as a country!</i>

00:56:18.792 --> 00:56:20.417
Big brother...

00:56:21.292 --> 00:56:27.583
U-Uhm... may I ask you to
join me for a picnic again?

00:56:30.250 --> 00:56:32.125
Sure.

00:56:32.125 --> 00:56:34.875
Thank you very much!

00:56:34.875 --> 00:56:37.833
Well then, good night.

00:56:41.542 --> 00:56:43.542
G-Good night.

00:56:43.542 --> 00:56:44.375
Hetalia!

00:56:44.375 --> 00:56:45.417
Hetalia.

00:56:47.375 --> 00:56:49.042
Hm?

00:56:49.042 --> 00:56:52.667
Hey, Japan. Some kid has been
making a racket for a while now.

00:56:52.667 --> 00:56:55.667
Really? Sorry...

00:56:55.667 --> 00:56:59.250
But... I live alone.

00:56:59.250 --> 00:57:04.625
<i>He must be tired from a long trip.</i>
<i>That's why he's hallucinating.</i>

00:57:06.458 --> 00:57:11.167
Mr. England. You should go
ahead and take a bath first.

00:57:11.167 --> 00:57:16.125
Hmm... Japan has somehow been acting strange.

00:57:16.125 --> 00:57:19.625
Is this what you call the
difference between cultures?

00:57:22.125 --> 00:57:24.792
Did I do something weird?

00:57:30.583 --> 00:57:33.667
Ah! A human has come, huh?

00:57:33.667 --> 00:57:36.250
Sorry. We'll get out right away!

00:57:37.958 --> 00:57:40.792
Well...

00:57:40.792 --> 00:57:43.375
I don't mind you being in the bath with me.

00:57:43.375 --> 00:57:46.167
Th-thank you very much, sir!

00:57:46.167 --> 00:57:49.500
More importantly, sorry to ask you
a favor when we've just met, but...

00:57:49.500 --> 00:57:52.167
Could you tell me about Japanese culture?

00:57:52.167 --> 00:57:53.333
Sure thing!

00:57:53.333 --> 00:57:57.333
No one else would know more
about Japanese culture than us. Right?

00:57:57.333 --> 00:57:58.375
Sure!

00:57:58.375 --> 00:58:03.750
Well, the sushi you foreigners are
familiar with was created rather recently.

00:58:03.750 --> 00:58:05.792
Oh? I didn't know that.

00:58:05.792 --> 00:58:09.250
I recommend the fish from Kanazawa!

00:58:11.458 --> 00:58:15.125
Mr. England, you were in
the bath for quite a long time.

00:58:15.125 --> 00:58:17.625
I had a nice chat with those
who were already in there

00:58:17.625 --> 00:58:19.542
and it was really fun, so...

00:58:19.542 --> 00:58:20.333
What?!

00:58:20.333 --> 00:58:22.667
Well then, I'll go on ahead and go to bed.

00:58:22.667 --> 00:58:26.375
Ah, okay. Good night.

00:58:26.375 --> 00:58:30.042
Like I said, I live alone, you know.

00:58:30.208 --> 00:58:31.083
Hetalia!

00:58:34.375 --> 00:58:36.583
Sir! Sir!

00:58:37.875 --> 00:58:41.625
It's me. Thanks so much for everything earlier.

00:58:41.625 --> 00:58:43.875
Oh, you guys.

00:58:45.417 --> 00:58:49.833
It was really fun today, wasn't it?
Let's take a bath together again tomorrow.

00:58:49.833 --> 00:58:55.375
Well, we'd love to, but... we're going
to retire to the mountains today.

00:58:56.083 --> 00:59:00.500
That's why we were taking a
bath as our last memory here.

00:59:03.708 --> 00:59:04.875
Thank you.

00:59:04.875 --> 00:59:08.958
Well, although, long ago,
humans were scared of us,

00:59:08.958 --> 00:59:13.958
they believed in our
existence and were close to us.

00:59:13.958 --> 00:59:17.250
But the times changed.

00:59:17.250 --> 00:59:22.500
Before we knew it, our
existence became just superstition.

00:59:22.500 --> 00:59:26.250
We used to be able to
talk with Mr. Japan, too...

00:59:26.250 --> 00:59:28.125
But we can't at all nowadays.

00:59:28.125 --> 00:59:31.333
B-But wouldn't it be all right to stay here?

00:59:31.333 --> 00:59:32.750
No...

00:59:32.750 --> 00:59:37.250
The time we were allowed to stay here is over.

00:59:37.250 --> 00:59:42.250
It was a pleasure to have a
great time with you at the end.

00:59:42.250 --> 00:59:43.875
I see...

00:59:45.667 --> 00:59:49.417
Well then, sir. Take care.

00:59:49.417 --> 00:59:53.125
Yeah. Let's take a bath
together again some day!

00:59:53.125 --> 00:59:56.167
Yeah, that'd be nice!

01:00:01.250 --> 01:00:05.333
Whoa!

01:00:05.333 --> 01:00:09.500
So you were the one making
all that noise earlier! Wait up!

01:00:09.500 --> 01:00:13.458
--Hey! Dammit! You're so quick! Stop!

01:00:13.458 --> 01:00:17.417
--Like I've been saying, I live alone!
--Hey! Dammit! You're so quick! Stop!

01:00:17.417 --> 01:00:19.250
Who the heck are you?!

01:00:19.250 --> 01:00:20.250
Hetalia.

01:00:22.500 --> 01:00:25.875
<i>Chi bao le</i>! I'm full now.

01:00:25.875 --> 01:00:29.125
I never imagined that you had a
vacation home on this island, too.

01:00:29.125 --> 01:00:31.583
I completely forgot about it.

01:00:31.583 --> 01:00:34.333
But this seafood pasta is pretty good, too.

01:00:34.333 --> 01:00:36.167
--It's good!
--Like I said, go home!

01:00:36.167 --> 01:00:38.875
Pasta!

01:00:45.875 --> 01:00:49.750
Geez... How can he take it
easy and sleep at a time like this?!

01:00:49.750 --> 01:00:53.917
But thanks to Italy, we
were able to have some food.

01:00:53.917 --> 01:00:55.958
Hey! I contributed, too!

01:00:55.958 --> 01:01:00.458
At any rate, I wonder why they
stopped attacking for a moment

01:01:00.458 --> 01:01:03.417
when they saw Italy.

01:01:09.583 --> 01:01:11.083
Beats me.

01:01:11.083 --> 01:01:14.875
I bet they just got dumbfounded
by his happy-go-lucky face, that's all.

01:01:14.875 --> 01:01:16.583
Yeah, that must be it!

01:01:34.667 --> 01:01:36.042
They're here!

01:01:36.042 --> 01:01:37.667
It appears so.

01:01:47.417 --> 01:01:49.417
--This is bad!
--It's coming this way!

01:01:50.083 --> 01:01:53.500
Just leave things to me now!

01:01:53.500 --> 01:01:55.833
Ah, you idiot! It's dangerous!

01:01:55.833 --> 01:01:58.208
I'll be fine!

01:02:02.833 --> 01:02:05.875
Charge!

01:02:18.875 --> 01:02:22.042
I've modified my land for this purpose!

01:02:31.417 --> 01:02:34.000
What did I tell you?! You idiot!

01:02:44.167 --> 01:02:46.250
It stop... ped?

01:02:48.125 --> 01:02:50.167
No, it didn't stop!!

01:02:50.875 --> 01:02:52.917
What's about to happen?

01:03:24.333 --> 01:03:25.542
What the hell is this?!

01:03:25.542 --> 01:03:28.083
This Eiffel Tower isn't cool at all!

01:03:28.083 --> 01:03:30.042
But why are they here?

01:03:30.042 --> 01:03:34.958
Could it be that they're making their
own city, with this area as their base?!

01:03:34.958 --> 01:03:36.583
What?!

01:03:46.042 --> 01:03:47.750
Italy! Get up!

01:03:47.750 --> 01:03:49.958
What?! Why? Why?

01:03:53.458 --> 01:03:54.500
I'm scared!

01:03:54.500 --> 01:03:55.167
Don't cry!

01:03:55.167 --> 01:03:58.458
No! No! Those guys look serious!

01:03:58.458 --> 01:04:02.875
Even so, don't cry! In any case, <i>you </i>can't cry!

01:04:02.875 --> 01:04:05.333
I'm scared!

01:04:05.333 --> 01:04:07.917
Please, I'm begging you. Don't cry.

01:04:12.417 --> 01:04:13.833
Wait!

01:04:13.833 --> 01:04:15.375
Hey! Italy!

01:04:15.375 --> 01:04:16.958
Germany!

01:04:16.958 --> 01:04:21.167
Looks like it's no time for
dealing with that wimpy guy.

01:04:29.708 --> 01:04:32.125
Yeah, seems like it.

01:04:32.167 --> 01:04:33.167
Hetalia.

01:04:33.167 --> 01:04:34.208
Hetalia!

01:04:34.208 --> 01:04:35.167
Hetalia!

01:04:35.708 --> 01:04:38.792
Japan, do you think you can
make U-boats at your place using

01:04:38.792 --> 01:04:40.458
the blueprints from the other day?

01:04:40.458 --> 01:04:44.250
Well, that design doesn't look
like it'd be possible in my home.

01:04:44.250 --> 01:04:45.792
But please don't worry.

01:04:45.792 --> 01:04:48.583
We succeeded in miniaturizing
it by using our technology.

01:04:48.583 --> 01:04:49.708
Whoa!

01:04:49.708 --> 01:04:51.167
"U-Boat"

01:04:51.167 --> 01:04:53.667
We created it in 12 colors, too.

01:04:53.667 --> 01:04:56.083
We'll also release new
colors that match each season.

01:04:56.083 --> 01:04:58.750
By the way, the public announcements
are by a popular voice actress.

01:04:58.750 --> 01:05:00.125
Whoa!

01:05:03.625 --> 01:05:05.542
And that's the final form.

01:05:05.542 --> 01:05:07.167
This is amazing, Japan!

01:05:07.167 --> 01:05:08.042
Whoa!

01:05:08.125 --> 01:05:09.042
Hetalia.

01:05:09.708 --> 01:05:12.500
Okay, Italy! It's your turn for lookout duty.

01:05:12.500 --> 01:05:13.542
I'm sleepy.

01:05:13.542 --> 01:05:16.583
You guys were just sleeping
a little while ago. Get a grip!

01:05:16.583 --> 01:05:18.208
Dejection...

01:05:23.500 --> 01:05:25.208
The Germans have gone to bed.

01:05:25.208 --> 01:05:28.000
All right! Let's carry out our plan!

01:05:37.750 --> 01:05:40.625
So they all defected in such
a short period of time, huh?

01:05:40.625 --> 01:05:43.583
They're pros, aren't they?

01:05:43.583 --> 01:05:44.583
Hetalia!

01:05:48.292 --> 01:05:51.042
Japan! Good morning!

01:05:51.042 --> 01:05:51.917
Hm?

01:05:51.917 --> 01:05:53.083
Hug!

01:05:53.083 --> 01:05:57.875
Wh... Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What're you doing?!

01:05:57.875 --> 01:05:59.792
This is my first time!

01:05:59.792 --> 01:06:02.042
What?

01:06:02.042 --> 01:06:04.958
I-In any case, I want
you to take responsibility.

01:06:04.958 --> 01:06:06.375
What?

01:06:06.375 --> 01:06:07.375
Hetalia!

01:06:09.833 --> 01:06:11.417
Italy...

01:06:11.417 --> 01:06:13.667
Holy Rome...

01:06:15.500 --> 01:06:17.083
Italy...

01:06:17.083 --> 01:06:19.125
Holy Rome...

01:06:19.125 --> 01:06:20.333
Italy...

01:06:20.333 --> 01:06:22.000
Holy Rome...

01:06:22.000 --> 01:06:23.125
Italy...

01:06:23.125 --> 01:06:24.792
Holy Rome...

01:06:24.792 --> 01:06:26.375
Italy...

01:06:26.375 --> 01:06:27.667
Holy Rome...

01:06:27.667 --> 01:06:29.083
Italy...

01:06:29.083 --> 01:06:31.083
"Soap Opera - The Morning of Farewell"
"To be continued"

01:06:31.125 --> 01:06:32.125
Hetalia!

01:06:49.875 --> 01:06:52.375
Kol, kol...! Kol, kol...!

01:07:06.042 --> 01:07:09.292
My hands...! My hands...!

01:07:12.083 --> 01:07:13.708
China!

01:07:22.083 --> 01:07:23.708
America!

01:07:32.417 --> 01:07:34.625
How dare you...!

01:07:34.625 --> 01:07:36.375
Don't mess with us!

01:07:59.708 --> 01:08:01.042
G-Germany?!

01:08:01.042 --> 01:08:03.042
<i>Ai ya</i>!

01:08:03.042 --> 01:08:06.708
I'm rapidly becoming a Pictonian!

01:08:06.708 --> 01:08:07.417
Me, too!

01:08:07.417 --> 01:08:08.917
What the hell?! Stop it!

01:08:08.917 --> 01:08:10.083
Ahh... Ahh...

01:08:10.083 --> 01:08:12.667
--Kol, kol...
--This is uncool!

01:08:12.667 --> 01:08:14.542
The others, too!

01:08:16.667 --> 01:08:20.958
No! I don't want them to become <i>noppera</i>!

01:08:25.792 --> 01:08:29.000
Italy... smile...!

01:08:29.000 --> 01:08:32.750
Why?! Even though
there's <i>noppera </i>everywhere?!

01:08:32.750 --> 01:08:37.625
Even so, smile! If you smile...

01:08:37.625 --> 01:08:39.917
Smile, Italy!

01:08:39.917 --> 01:08:43.542
No! <i>Noppera </i>is scary!

01:08:43.542 --> 01:08:48.792
I-I-Italy!

01:09:02.292 --> 01:09:05.000
Ita...ly...

01:09:12.750 --> 01:09:16.750
I don't like <i>noppera</i>!

01:09:22.542 --> 01:09:29.125
♪ In this world, Heaven is where ♪

01:09:29.125 --> 01:09:35.625
♪ the cooks are French, ♪

01:09:35.625 --> 01:09:38.875
♪ the policemen are British, ♪

01:09:38.875 --> 01:09:42.208
♪ the engineers are German, ♪

01:09:42.208 --> 01:09:45.792
♪ the bankers are Swiss, ♪

01:09:45.792 --> 01:09:51.208
♪ and your lover is an Italian! ♪

01:10:05.958 --> 01:10:09.125
♪ In this world, Hell is where ♪

01:10:09.125 --> 01:10:12.292
♪ the cooks are British, ♪

01:10:12.292 --> 01:10:14.875
♪ the policemen are German, ♪

01:10:14.875 --> 01:10:17.417
♪ the engineers are French, ♪

01:10:17.417 --> 01:10:19.833
♪ your lover is Swiss, ♪

01:10:19.833 --> 01:10:24.042
♪ and the bankers are Italians! ♪

01:10:25.292 --> 01:10:27.208
Thank you!

01:10:31.417 --> 01:10:41.708
Oh no... Oh no... Oh no... Seriously...?
Oh no... Oh no... Oh no... Seriously...?

01:10:41.708 --> 01:10:43.625
Grandpa Rome!

01:10:52.417 --> 01:10:54.917
Why is this here?

01:10:54.917 --> 01:10:59.458
I wonder if Grandpa Rome left it here.

01:10:59.458 --> 01:11:02.167
Oh, yeah!

01:11:07.208 --> 01:11:09.375
Yaay! I drew a face!

01:11:09.375 --> 01:11:09.833
Seriously?

01:11:09.833 --> 01:11:11.708
Yep, I'm serious!

01:11:12.292 --> 01:11:13.917
A face?

01:11:21.917 --> 01:11:26.042
--Face, face...! Face, face...!
--It won't come off... It won't come off...

01:11:26.042 --> 01:11:30.708
Permanent marker... Permanent marker...

01:11:30.708 --> 01:11:37.292
Ah! I found Germany!

01:11:37.292 --> 01:11:40.000
Yaay! I drew it very well!

01:11:40.000 --> 01:11:43.000
Oh yeah, I'll draw everyone else's, too!

01:12:04.125 --> 01:12:06.292
What's up with your weird faces?!

01:12:06.292 --> 01:12:08.250
Well, your face is weird, too, America!

01:12:08.250 --> 01:12:10.208
What?! Me, too?! Is mine weird, too?!

01:12:10.208 --> 01:12:10.958
--Oh no! Oh no! Oh no! Oh no! Oh nooo!

01:12:10.958 --> 01:12:13.375
--Ah, everyone! Mr. Germany is...!
--Oh no! Oh no! Oh no! Oh no! Oh nooo!

01:12:17.167 --> 01:12:19.750
Ah! Germany's face is back!

01:12:19.750 --> 01:12:24.417
<i>Ai ya</i>! My body is going back to normal, too!

01:12:24.417 --> 01:12:25.250
Oh, wonderful!

01:12:25.250 --> 01:12:26.208
All right!

01:12:26.208 --> 01:12:27.583
Beautiful! I'm beautiful!

01:12:27.583 --> 01:12:28.708
Vodka!

01:12:28.708 --> 01:12:30.458
I'm really glad.

01:12:35.917 --> 01:12:38.792
Italy... You did a good job.

01:12:41.333 --> 01:12:42.375
Hetalia!

01:12:42.375 --> 01:12:43.375
Hetalia!

01:12:45.833 --> 01:12:50.458
Hey, Japan. Germany said that you're
amazing at stuff like miniaturizing.

01:12:50.458 --> 01:12:52.125
Miniaturize me, too.

01:12:52.125 --> 01:12:54.917
I'm sorry, but we don't accept orders

01:12:54.917 --> 01:12:57.417
--to miniaturize Italians.
--Whoa, amazing! You miniaturized this, too?!

01:12:59.167 --> 01:13:01.583
So you've found it out...
I guess I have no choice.

01:13:02.583 --> 01:13:04.417
Whoa!

01:13:04.417 --> 01:13:06.333
What the heck is this?!

01:13:06.333 --> 01:13:09.208
Whoa! Amazing! Whoa!

01:13:09.292 --> 01:13:10.208
Hetalia.

01:13:11.333 --> 01:13:14.583
<i>I wonder why this guy is so weak...</i>

01:13:14.583 --> 01:13:17.583
I ate really awful pizza the other day.

01:13:17.583 --> 01:13:19.542
It was England who made it.

01:13:19.542 --> 01:13:24.667
<i>He's theoretically a descendent of</i>
<i>Roman Empire, so he's got good genes.</i>

01:13:24.667 --> 01:13:28.292
Look, Germany. There's
something going on over there.

01:13:28.292 --> 01:13:34.458
Well, tomatoes contain elements
that reduce the will to fight and

01:13:34.458 --> 01:13:38.208
research results show that they make
people wimps for long periods of time.

01:13:38.208 --> 01:13:42.625
Whoa... that guy is saying something stupid.

01:13:44.917 --> 01:13:46.958
Now it makes sense...

01:13:47.125 --> 01:13:48.000
Hetalia!

01:13:48.000 --> 01:13:51.708
All right! I'm the first one to arrive at
today's Allies conference for a change!

01:13:51.708 --> 01:13:53.750
To those who come later...

01:13:53.750 --> 01:13:55.375
Aren't you guys late?

01:13:55.375 --> 01:13:59.000
I'll tell that to them!
I wonder how they'll react.

01:13:59.000 --> 01:14:00.125
Hm?

01:14:00.125 --> 01:14:01.583
E-England?!

01:14:01.583 --> 01:14:02.917
All right, it's done!

01:14:02.917 --> 01:14:03.667
"Italy" "Germany" "Japan"

01:14:03.667 --> 01:14:05.750
"Italy" "Germany" "Japan"
Well, I guess this is about it, huh?

01:14:05.750 --> 01:14:08.792
<i>Th-Those portraits...</i>
<i>So it was you who always...?</i>

01:14:08.833 --> 01:14:09.833
Hetalia!

01:14:10.583 --> 01:14:13.083
Wh-What the heck are these weird drawings?!

01:14:13.083 --> 01:14:16.333
In addition to the usual drawings,
there're weirder drawings of us!

01:14:16.333 --> 01:14:17.500
"Pickax"
Who drew them?!

01:14:17.500 --> 01:14:19.750
"Pickax"
It doesn't reflect my beauty at all!

01:14:19.750 --> 01:14:21.333
Don't my eyebrows look crazy?

01:14:21.333 --> 01:14:24.875
--We often see the drawings at the bottom, but...
--If this drawing is supposed to be me,

01:14:24.875 --> 01:14:26.458
I'll drill a hole in the blackboard. Is it okay?

01:14:26.458 --> 01:14:27.708
Don't do that!

01:14:27.708 --> 01:14:29.125
Ahh!

01:14:29.125 --> 01:14:34.125
Seriously, this is annoying.
To see someone drew us like this...

01:14:34.125 --> 01:14:38.083
How dare he flexibly express
us with such skilled sketches

01:14:38.083 --> 01:14:41.167
using boldly deformed innovative
and cute American pop art styles

01:14:41.167 --> 01:14:43.000
he learned in New York.

01:14:43.000 --> 01:14:44.708
It's really unforgivable, isn't it?!

01:14:46.625 --> 01:14:47.750
So it was you.

01:14:47.750 --> 01:14:48.875
<i>Ai ya</i>!

01:14:48.958 --> 01:14:49.875
Hetalia!

01:14:50.042 --> 01:14:54.042
It can't be helped.
From the next time, I'll draw.

01:14:57.375 --> 01:15:00.667
Whaaaaaaaat?! China, you...!

01:15:00.750 --> 01:15:01.792
Hetalia!

01:15:01.792 --> 01:15:02.667
Hetalia!

01:15:35.750 --> 01:15:38.375
Thank you for turning them bac--

01:15:49.375 --> 01:15:50.917
Wh-What the hell is this?!

01:15:50.917 --> 01:15:53.542
Hey, don't tell me that's their boss!

01:15:56.292 --> 01:16:01.375
I am really sorry for all the fuss we caused.

01:16:01.375 --> 01:16:06.583
We came to conquer this planet,

01:16:06.583 --> 01:16:11.167
but since this place is somehow
very fun, we'll leave without changing it.

01:16:12.208 --> 01:16:14.875
You drew faces for us, too.

01:16:14.875 --> 01:16:18.875
We'll responsibly turn other
people back to their old selves

01:16:18.875 --> 01:16:23.708
and bring them back to their
own country. So please do not worry.

01:16:24.875 --> 01:16:25.708
Also...

01:16:25.708 --> 01:16:26.500
Hm?

01:16:26.500 --> 01:16:29.042
May I have that?

01:16:29.042 --> 01:16:30.083
Hm?

01:16:30.083 --> 01:16:34.625
We don't have it on my planet.

01:16:34.625 --> 01:16:37.208
Sure! No problem!

01:16:37.208 --> 01:16:38.458
Here!

01:16:38.458 --> 01:16:40.417
Thank you very much.

01:16:43.792 --> 01:16:45.667
I'll cherish it.

01:16:49.750 --> 01:16:52.250
Well then, farewell.

01:17:09.167 --> 01:17:13.250
Goodbye! Please take good care of everyone!

01:17:13.250 --> 01:17:16.125
Come visit us again!

01:17:22.375 --> 01:17:24.875
Hey! It wouldn't be good if
they come again, would it?!

01:17:36.875 --> 01:17:38.500
Big brother...

01:17:46.708 --> 01:17:50.083
It's another wonderful morning, isn't it?

01:17:50.083 --> 01:17:51.708
Yeah.

01:17:53.833 --> 01:17:56.792
By the way, how are we going to get home?

01:17:56.792 --> 01:17:59.875
Shoot! We should've
asked them to give us a lift!

01:17:59.875 --> 01:18:04.083
Italy! It was your fault!
If you didn't say "goodbye"...!

01:18:04.083 --> 01:18:06.208
No need to be concerned!

01:18:06.208 --> 01:18:07.625
Hm?

01:18:07.625 --> 01:18:13.167
I'll take you home on my land!

01:18:13.167 --> 01:18:18.250
<i>I'll deliberately do them a favor and have</i>
<i>them accept me as a country this time for sure!</i>

01:18:18.250 --> 01:18:20.333
Okay then! Let's go back
and have a world conference!

01:18:20.333 --> 01:18:21.333
--No...
--Hm?

01:18:21.333 --> 01:18:24.417
Before that, why don't
we all try <i>bon </i>dancing?

01:18:24.417 --> 01:18:26.250
What?!

01:18:26.917 --> 01:18:29.042
Why <i>bon </i>dancing?

01:18:29.042 --> 01:18:30.042
Beats me.

01:18:30.042 --> 01:18:33.167
Yaay! I'll dance! I'll dance!

01:18:33.167 --> 01:18:38.750
"After that, everyone went home via
China's food procurement route."

01:18:38.750 --> 01:18:40.708
I will...!

01:18:40.708 --> 01:18:42.958
<i>Wa! Wa! Wa!!</i>

01:18:42.958 --> 01:18:44.708
<i>Hey, Hey, sole!</i>

01:18:44.708 --> 01:18:47.000
<i>Wa! Wa! Wa!!</i>

01:18:47.000 --> 01:18:49.000
<i>Hey, Soviet Union!</i>

01:18:50.250 --> 01:18:53.417
<i>Ai ya! Ai ya!</i>

01:18:54.708 --> 01:18:57.208
<i>Hey, sole!</i>

01:18:57.208 --> 01:19:01.208
<i>Joining hands, buon giorno</i>

01:19:01.208 --> 01:19:05.292
<i>Konnichiwa from Japan</i>

01:19:05.292 --> 01:19:08.542
<i>Keeping the pace, guten tag</i>

01:19:08.542 --> 01:19:17.250
<i>Now, let's do It-aly together (Sole!)</i>

